-tex=\"$c\\le c&#x27;$\">$c\\le c&#x27;$</span>, then it is at most <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$c&#x27;$\">$c&#x27;$</span>.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p>\\sketch </p><p>Every <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$r&gt;c&#x27;$\">$r&gt;c&#x27;$</span> also satisfies <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$r&gt;c$\">$r&gt;c$</span>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#def:forward-difference-quotient","next":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:right-derivative-forward-difference-quotient","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#def:forward-difference-quotient","title":"def:forward-difference-quotient","label":"def:forward-difference-quotient"}],"backlinks":[],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:forward-difference-quotient-mono","title":"lem:forward-difference-quotient-mono","tex":"\\begin{lemma}[Weakening a forward difference quotient bound]\n\\label{lem:forward-difference-quotient-mono}\n\n\\uses{def:forward-difference-quotient}\n\n\n\n\nIf the forward difference quotient of $f$ at $t$ is at most $c$ and\n$c\\le c'$, then it is at most $c'$.\n\\end{lemma}\n\\begin{proof}\n\\sketch\n\nEvery $r>c'$ also satisfies $r>c$.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#def:forward-difference-quotient","title":"def:forward-difference-quotient","description":""}]